{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1230,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3398cc4bc54a5b483d92d962",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……真是的。想要恶作剧的话\r\n就给我堂堂正正的干啊。突然从背后\r\n挠痒痒什么的太卑鄙了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "66ec249278e49e77de4bf776ae4c7af1e9dd196ccc8fd9338df26ea97d1a7e30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0cba3d0143ffe3eb103b9bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "飞驹她教了我一些很帅的动作啊！\r\n这次的比赛要是赢了的话，就做给你看看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c4696212bd5cb0f86c1d7c4b452ee1a62c1737794d2cd8db32bbee5e6309435",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed5972942d5fbd5baa33489c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“像老妈一样”…啊没有啦、和阿雪\r\n一起洗衣服的时候被她这么说了…\r\n我的衣品有这么老气吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e38f5387891d71df026c0e747c9c8dfc214400adfdd6eff58eda293ef868c4f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f85aa3c8527337abffae732e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别再发呆了哦。\r\n在菱亚马逊姐面前、你可不准怠慢哟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21757a468aeb708a6911865893c22ff5f2208c7e7e38fbee38054b0455b13346",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdfeb065ac5fc9aa0e4e1f29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会让你看到最棒的表演哦！\r\n回应粉丝的应援也是我们应该做的对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a55b4cd075f585576331eebd92cd39b3551b869e396fa9e826f4cc8a9ae60c82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e5fd83c3dcc4dc7d9b84d49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服，感觉真拘束啊……\r\n稍微脱一件不行吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "74bea6bff491fe2a2b56ae81c5e33d6d83f9b8870453f734b1a808051186a8a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:043b4c9174219b4462260bd5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因为穿着这件决胜服、\r\n所以不全力取胜可不行啊。\r\n要问为什么的话，因为这样很引人注目啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ec683d8b29c6b024688d14446fdad4e2d109eebb616c14ff40c3b7da5fb7276",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f20ad5a47bd0077b18b4c07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身动起来很方便不是很好嘛！\r\n不管对手是谁、我都觉得能够大胜而归哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc060111e679978db233b2166f578d8e9025013cf4c00619508555d02a5c6c53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:474760396e355a6719b25f84",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听我说啊！今天的我在闹钟\r\n响之前就起床了哦！\r\n呀～心情真好啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0fa941f60e8ed2e92959056cb901c4ba9f877c026af9a5a0245199206b1e4bea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a9d83bc9e2e9063f62ec0c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一副肚子饿了的表情呢。\r\n要给你做点啥吃的吗？虽然也就只能\r\n做个土豆炖肉或者是鸡蛋烧啥的就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15bdf6d255b0cf64f30b53e9089e0246beb35d3b3b9596f84ff9db3f1840f57b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef9f5bbd4aa3e1db98d9f1d4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好险啊……和白仁她一起跑步、\r\n一不注意就忘记时间了…身为宿舍长\r\n却超过门禁时间的话可笑不出来啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "78d8ae7d38433d15a1956325fe7bf2751b9fe999be0642e02ee32bd034a2fb92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:663706c6600b14157343670c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "带新生参观学园真累人啊……\r\n嘛、但只要看到那份闪闪发光的脸庞的话\r\n、马上就能打起精神了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36e5a52a4c4fd1665f03dae0c550dd700147e361954cc217db56fd5c54c40c12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03ab5cedb806f05e2c3c9e79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每到夏天的时候要洗的衣服就会变多呢……\r\n只是准备好晾衣服的地方就很累了呀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41f07a82a72c0e84be949385f232ca001a120973317ce2cb51b7f5b378d51792",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1095ef07440aaabea925004d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然红叶很漂亮、\r\n但一想到扫落叶的事是要自己干、\r\n就感觉心情稍微有点复杂呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b324975e4040b4325d2bbe9d0e7dc3df32fa97c66d4dc081dd2c21a54421680d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ce96931f26cac7ab9df14b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总感觉很冷呢。\r\n这种时候就好好地搓搓手吧。\r\n会暖起来的哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98bd236f613b9fac9bd9548597ec50c7fc5d589d0da02958780fec916d0f310e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3139d5bd0a9fa4279bbe6ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你看到小花的婚纱打扮了吗？\r\n那套可爱的衣服很适合她，\r\n都让我想东摸摸西摸摸了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03482c362a4abc800742f67a6c36af38b4660869c2163a467040bbb115385fad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f07e5fcb4287895fecf303e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有帮她织过小真娃娃。\r\n她说让她开心到不行，\r\n还很宝贝地收在抽屉里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6b797ccefa4d0c01491ae3b1692767958544b174c8d36cd02695cccd8865991",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6b264f5815ddbcd96f5c4c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "她说「我还以为你是故事里的\r\n公主」。能不能想办法矫正一下\r\n富士爱说花言巧语的习惯啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5a1cca39dd999e15bc8435ef8265c4c53005cdb29b0e095f8b102d1b34797eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40533b39334b4a434192e876",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我哥哥姐姐都很乖巧。\r\n多亏如此，\r\n我这个老么长成这样了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "367870a2bf56a7b9991d133d4a2c5fd6098aaab1b4ee8f5bd20fc1f260471bf4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d93d19047896d63a9610fd13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望人家怎么跟我求婚是吗？\r\n……唔，伤脑筋。我只想得到\r\n自己跟人求婚的模样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d1d21dbd008947010a1afb0b76a29a7da9d52641abdce0439d799dbe3f4de3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d67a5d3da24a9f480caa6f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们有很多学生早上爬不起来。\r\n今天早上我也担心她们会迟到，\r\n一整个提心吊胆的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7e3706a183d28b4667511eeec2e7b7377b7b3e6773232664bc73ac3ca83deed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c67842c00d0331c5ab58b8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦，吃便当的时间到了！\r\n如果天气好的话，\r\n就到顶楼看看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cbec02a3d7dacd365e1cbdeb4ae8d0e99709c0e2c22ad7c39ba7ec58bc10071",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e49ae94b3ee3024a2f3f049",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我记得澡堂的洗发精好像快用完了。\r\n得去问问负责的职员\r\n还有没有库存才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4eebab183c536b22d2c82b2658647f75393dd3467da5256815aca9cae58d4ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6331f7f194a71b11ae64fa10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走在春天的花径中真舒畅！还能\r\n采到许多看起来很好吃的油菜花。\r\n下次你要不要一起来呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "15a82052873e7c2b6662274ff807474a2a1fe1f63e6ac030bb7bfe5acb348eca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e279031698ead585422883e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏天晚上跑步很舒服。\r\n这点我明白……但我不能接受\r\n违反门禁时间的人变多！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b3403750dd27055ab8afe84c639f554d78f824e996a0f248a2cf62f230fc1725",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e6fe16e8b3cfa9449ec8910",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「月夜中特别亮眼的婚纱」啊……\r\n……啊，不，是大家在宿舍赏月时\r\n莫名在起哄啦！真是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "933ce84cb0681e580041dd728c89f8d556c74297893dd5ca2e8d626ae35cfedb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb7fa55f82b13da90df3d87e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近一直很冷，我替你\r\n缝了一件棉袍！顺带一提，\r\n花纹跟我的一样喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce19098b3df91125d450c138ee09cf65873df4c3738cf9f502f1b518fc54d78c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92719a5d00399241cea7b2ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样？这很有异国风情\r\n又狂野的设计……嘿嘿！\r\n不负「女杰」的名号吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0f20ae6f962a2266673922f187604c4f7404f85908a94c1000f9e516186d75b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:184a5a0d9dc68b1e3e0b7d68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一想到它是婚纱，\r\n该说是觉得害臊吗……\r\n总觉得内心静不下来耶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "693c20df48e4ad967ccbec28c2da64a87784f6802dba2d741ff0972eb8ae7931",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1de507c7ba988ca143297a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好——那么开始训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0366cba1e7248a0db251f3129d48f165db79b02e8a13e4e2b290dfcea1cc48c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e79aeab5d2b7a6ee78c950d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くよっ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f75f5ed6e71a6a892ffd950db60dcb6bebc7690e8ca20162fa4b5818b4a198c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4efa519083f293337bfe9ecc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就让你见识下你菱亚马逊姐的实力吧\r\n可要好好地跟上来哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee992d8dcaad05f6a1ad499b83b113eb2ea8ab0ad90fbb46ede3cdbcaed812e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d84fcda961c5dbcf4435dde",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还想变得更快啊！\r\n开始训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2ba3925d8623c28a635f5e92554a89a29db23eadaf095c1a7672e233333053f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1fbfa17bb337b4149fa9124",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练说到底其实就是对自己的单挑。\r\n所以我绝不能认输！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d02ad8012771cae2d787b83c867121041c61719dd583f1604d4c3184d8469cf7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8768e10305a6fd4d4c09304",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "变得更强了这件事、\r\n还真是让人开心啊、训练公！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcf66dbc9e41c754420c9a5bd024a6cf2d1794e2e95637ccd21b4ad9d61b0b22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3303353cdb55900e88d8dc20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会变得越来越强的！\r\n得变得无论单挑的对手是谁、\r\n都不会输的程度才行呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e5742fa9aad9b17737295f61f34497b68ae9e9443622a53614bef776af69064",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9ae9fb564657c1b67f55aba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要我的搭档是你的话、\r\n感觉无论去到哪里我都能够变强呢！\r\n不觉得这样很让人兴奋不已吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2a206591a4bd5fbbc1a2a2ad7cf48558f05477487c1cac02c5cbe41851fc627",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f85d495f04fce57d6e9b9238",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好嘞！要情绪高涨地上了哦！\r\n无论做什么事情都要全力以赴！\r\n这就是我的作派！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dcdfc7bac12cc9bb265e47558c03cb2e54ea0f8c20039fa4f34ea0fd92f88c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98023bc0bc2cd0da2285815b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果不全力以赴，\r\n就没有脸面对婚纱了！\r\n今天也要卯起来单挑啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "535d777c31d6cddfa86ecfc4b453e4d65dc9e63ab9d57151d8d5b8001b57b435",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4e075ad515181a6a69d2129",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然衣服飘来飘去的，不过\r\n确实很好跑步。尽管有点不稳定……\r\n但那家伙果然是一流的啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "517eeafa7a90b2057313fe56d501d0ca874fe995c70a342f638b711c3b6d3c11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:947f33882556a23e1426ccb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，衣服真的会让人跟着\r\n充满干劲啊！来来来，\r\n有没有人想跟我单挑啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "39b800f6076aeefd0be6a389655cf0f8bb8c6b9e9c4e4f681a6e5f3e88736a8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70b41ba57cb3a06c39d1fc43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给你见识一下\r\n最强最棒的菱亚大姐，\r\n让你打从心底迷上我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e41c13984ed4c4e288245084e8f496a921158a112318e5d9e4fe40f726e2771b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0410179da131dbe12a978795",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们的路\r\n现在才要开始呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8cea0bafbce96942f40a57b2b1d891f3477e6fd6e49460e62762c7d9c50ebae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d33120e644c663d6a7c69ad7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光是你待在我身边，\r\n我就能变强不少了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9a4238a30cebe17358df57ffb31218ade404efed95873f462874c4ed0d9da13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16965038f292c937607dbbff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "往后的日子还很长，\r\n但我相信只要你当我的伙伴，\r\n我就走得下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef311c29b2808667b28486c17951d0cc09e7f944248730b12f80ee67ca31a899",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5b0d3b28082450ce2383432",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们二人的最强组合可是无敌的啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "85f43159773d49430a70d6cd44e89978fe62536f05e911f82817e21310389a06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0848e898aeb226deed2cb1b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑出了好几场不错的比赛呢……谢啦、训练公！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb05bcda8b1abdcf2caf5b5a5bf36ec713d9368b97c861c02a4d17808baaa739",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5af31a41920916260c56c3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和你在一起，就会让我想相信命运。",
      "source_fingerprint": "07d30c95832f8b5f6b604d05c34b5cbd5e5449ff6d38f7511c2505d05ddfa283",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:720df418fc12ba44613fc24a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练公，\r\n谢谢你带给我最棒的每一天！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0da03b5ba951cd01a5a7f9da46e8485d4fd97a3aa65f450a143cebdc5760dd79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25f59ba066f8a1d98270df77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真不错啊，感觉自己又变强了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78298a7ce0f3b2e36d4fc644f811d8469bfef43564bdd3d1eafad89c9e1bf265",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:288c8f0b2c3f0bf3fbcf2bf8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的真正实力可远远不止于此哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6a74d039e42693dff837871f02c34454723c11213ab78c225b8f1db6346a59f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb2f84bb6ec5915e4ec097a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是菱亚马逊！请多指教了哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7ea49133fd10359d32660a8f2625cd5de88362831849a784df2cf117509bcba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6fcf78908170005697f6d1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "单挑上等！\r\n就让我菱亚马逊姐来做你的对手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a687fd7d6930110be0fc8b58e9a9def6f316a18e7187d593a0e00e8e77bae645",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df9a75f7a17afa9926910e48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽管来依靠我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "884514a91f51aa6957ee977d5409fd9e1ca82c3cdb84efedbc28d36ba71fa311",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c2549e87a20359ec0f2a5ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就交给你菱亚马逊姐我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "db8524ae516b2cbc56143d42d022fca2679bba78ff54b5719cd0630db46d3a47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e68f816f90d62782bd87ded",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔精心打扮一下也不错呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5453d540949deb7048df133f96c076a1ee79ae56ba0dd5742e0848ad8fc8372",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34fa75a25df0a306ac6edc42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你找「女杰」菱亚马逊吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "77ff3c169d2551aef67805963836f3df69f24aedd410aab0a883b1da3a15f551",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6349919f6f2d60e8d6508308",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管什么时候，\r\n我都会带着你前进啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbd06520ce752d352f1ca23011cd940a07d5578a5988e030906a18c75712156a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9bbd68a82c75692c8e5a6de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是菱亚马逊！\r\n跟我来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54a4084ba0408cad9d1827ac8a116eed306f97a64621d266a4dd3f02eb40f7bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09965ec5a263126c00c6ff41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唯有英勇奋战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04d10428b52a3b6e999de21cbaa20ad3e9b4296b3705f8e3b36d80e6e72f5fdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e59b8ca09a4bb3515a8e9e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃自己喜欢的东西是很幸福的呢……\r\n这都多亏了训练员为我设计的菜单哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "949679c2ec9a1701512c3a15f0eb55d6d840f39a9a56807f2a9ac6ab0ece10a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8408bafc0d41067ad1344818",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行って参ります。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4987d3708730ebac0656ffbcb144c2a543ffd8cae52e81662000573920a03aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e3bf80234fe4748ed86d8bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま戻りましたわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33d7ee261bbe6dad3dbb0ae2cee1ae8e0c770f3e1fd45c49c24e6d025818369a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cdd544d0873ea422db72477",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是不可思议，\r\n不自觉地就会和训练员说出\r\n我的烦恼呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6944e574dd198e6739fd85bca8b2197994db9e5f315d58f41009e5e54a9326ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea63e3adf5b6a5a0061c4e6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次要不要一起去看运动比赛？\r\n前提是你不介意\r\n看到我激动的模样就是了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "23e6992c22c3baf17d2454b78e522f935a1a5b389ed41b6efbc5d5f3fd544540",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3299ed48d8d37f928d0fdd60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐。\r\n今年我会更认真努力地精进自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1fe384d66e45adf64a1af4c50e14dafbfd8ec199a42cabc09910cdf405bec9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78ba216401426565de90cd26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐。\r\n请收下我的巧克力，\r\n当作答谢你平时对我的照顾。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b347121de1d40a5ec2adae3913297c178645b8d43a16ee8d6351c2690ab3e8c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d87316a2898a78dfe66a1e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然比不上专业的味道，\r\n但这是我非常用心制作的巧克力……\r\n……你愿意吃吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdd1ab5f409af282ddfa5da56240cd50af91005faf3952f5a25d4c896b0b6621",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7da97dbc553f84e0032d1c41",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我向星星发誓，\r\n一定会达成我的夙愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3406042b36efcada41ea0d56c423a0874dd1112929e8729cfd1fa4da781ddd23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68e9ea98cd7b0358fe279098",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "什么万圣节嘛……\r\n呜呜……到处都是点心的诱惑……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "663cf894e99debe87f7a073e98c54c4fd0d820cedea88ee237ed86eb95407a4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bd3018111efeaa1bfe140ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目白家每年圣诞节的时候，\r\n都会订制特大的蛋糕，\r\n然后一群人一起举办派对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6e408d962514461e310363fef94c77842135d867976ff3c9090a57a1978ee64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd36fb6f75c69ac55ca97b1e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天我可以晚一点再睡吗……？\r\n我想要和你一起好好享受圣诞节……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fce52455df2dc5efa37b705f53aaf9f0bfe552c573d3ba569d422825b8359d95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:533b55ca69172c142e33d7d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干得漂亮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e9deba3fd1d32bb7e6ecc9fdd820f0ff3b0fc3c7d828d7babf2a4765856b130",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:631d76e8ee6ce906d0c57ad0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也经历了许多的事情。\r\n希望可以不白费那些经验，\r\n好好地活用在明年呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c249940efffb9bf95061d8b1d448b8015d7f2fa35c92354a0c44665fc570db0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fddd564674af98e4f9ce53c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐。\r\n这是一年只有一次的特别日子，\r\n我们就尽情地享受吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c42e096ce54acc3542dc157bf200c64d07fe50d79e78993e272507a35f6b3c00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5960dc1d2bc938469ebac066",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐。\r\n呵呵……你好像又变得更加可靠了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6b9c2b94ebfdc08019f939a54f0b0cf4ebb6e0c17690823acd08f5944b3f052",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6feab890753b398680fc6183",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我真的很感谢大家来为我祝贺。\r\n我得用成果来回报这份恩情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83ff6d73ce3ac52e01a6668f84de09fdc7baefa88d69f5aeaff11bd0039c8c6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:896cdf3c42c4f0af102ff9fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为今天是我的生日，\r\n我可以稍微任性一下吗？\r\n……请你和我一起吃蛋糕吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09f3307ce7ffbf74c46d47c7aefc4463067cbe7400ac086ba0a75911ecb8571c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00fe5b1490dbc20628fa214a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到了新公告。\r\n要确认一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc3b660072de3b4ec514a6958df8a5ddabcffc7413b53743697b73f25e541f25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a50c2ec0a313837537a8570",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有礼物哦。\r\n很期待看到里面装着什么呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d0f7942f17dc1c66ebeeb6830217c6c6292754a9acc442cbac3570ca04dc922",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1013",
        "10016"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
